  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agribusiness Trade Mission in the Beira corridor in Mozambique focused on developing connections between Dutch and Mozambique agribusiness companies.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall the mission will enable Dutch private, financial and knowledge organizations to understand the Mozambican agribusiness sector and how to do businesses in the country; while identify concrete opportunities for Dutch added value. 
 
Through the trade mission the following goals can be achieved: 
1.	Business to business cooperation between Dutch and Mozambican SMEs is stimulated/strengthened by networking and matchmaking; 
2.	Focus is on trade and investments that benefit people, create jobs and preferably, are accompanied by the transfer of knowledge and skills;
3.	Through business cooperation, the aim is to enhance food and nutritional security in Mozambique.</narrative>
  </description>
